{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/708","id":3018380128,"node_id":"PR_kwDOH8_sKs6z6NNg","html_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pull/708","diff_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pull/708.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pull/708.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/issues/708","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/708/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/708/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/issues/708/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pydantic/pydantic-settings/statuses/7d60367d8cc83fb49fb7d93568ff4f10fea9a904","number":708,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for AWS Secrets Manager VersionId parameter","user":{"login":"jcyamacho","id":4062731,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjI3MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4062731?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho","html_url":"https://github.com/jcyamacho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Add support for AWS Secrets Manager VersionId parameter\r\n\r\n### Summary\r\nAdds support for specifying a `VersionId` when retrieving secrets from AWS Secrets Manager, enabling retrieval of specific secret versions.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n- Added `version_id` parameter to `AWSSecretsManagerSettingsSource` constructor\r\n- Fixed handling of optional `VersionId` to only include it in the request when provided (prevents errors when `version_id` is `None`)\r\n\r\n### Implementation Details\r\n- The `version_id` parameter is optional and defaults to `None`\r\n- When `version_id` is provided, it's passed to the AWS Secrets Manager `get_secret_value` API call\r\n- The fix ensures `VersionId` is only included in the request dictionary when a value is provided, avoiding potential API errors\r\n\r\n### Files Changed\r\n- `pydantic_settings/sources/providers/aws.py`\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-17T17:41:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T08:26:42Z","closed_at":"2025-11-18T08:26:42Z","merged_at":"2025-11-18T08:26:42Z","merge_commit_sha":"7b924d2acddc31c9667383cb49a1cced976ca4f9","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jcyamacho:main","ref":"main","repo":null,"sha":"7d60367d8cc83fb49fb7d93568ff4f10fea9a904","user":{"login":"jcyamacho","id":4062731,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjI3MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4062731?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho","html_url":"https://github.com/jcyamacho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcyamacho/orgs",